            text: _("Blast! Haven’t seen outlaws in these parts since I were a lad... these ones even dare to leave their faces uncovered. What do you make of it, Thea?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("I don’t know, Father. This is a strange thing. These outlaws couldn’t’ve come from the other villages — the other aldermen won’t stand for troublemakers."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rael",
            text: _("Well, it’s a good thing I’ve been keeping my old war-bow waxed. There’s nothing for it but to drive them off. Constable Elyn, report!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Elyn",
            type: "Javelineer",
            side: 0,
            x: 10,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Elyn",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Elyn",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyn",
            text: _("(yawn) It’s too early for this, Pa..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("I’ll get to our keep and rally the farmers too; get a posse together. It’ll take more than the three of us to win this fight."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Thea",
            x: 17,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Thea",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rael",
            text: _("Well done for taking the initiative, Thea. Let’s show these pirates what we stand for. What do you say, lads?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "fisher",
            text: _("Rah!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_19",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "variable",
                name: "enable_tutorial_elements",
                equals: "yes",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rael",
            text: _("(whistles) There’s more of them than I expected. We’re going to be outnumbered until we have the time and gold to rally a larger force."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyn",
            text: _("We’ll need more experienced fighters, too. You’ve done your best to train me and Thea, Pa, but most of the farmers are just that... farmers."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_20",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22canrecruit%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_killer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_second%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Elyn%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyn",
            text: _("Take that! Don’t mess with Rochelm!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_21",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "failed_achievement",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_23",
        on: "branch_if_23",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "failed_achievement",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_achievement",
            id: "pap_s01",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_24",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("Well, that sounded ominous."),
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Crier",
            type: "Cavalryman",
            side: 3,
            x: 30,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Crier",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Crier",
            x: 23,
            y: 3,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Crier",
            text: _("Hear ye! Word from Weldyn! I bring a proclamation from King Garard!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rael",
            text: _("Oh? Fortunate timing. Mayhaps this will explain our bandit attack."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Crier",
            text: _("No news of outlaws, goodman. Ahem..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "portraits/scroll.webp",
            text: _("<i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "portraits/scroll.webp",
            text: _("<i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "portraits/scroll.webp",
            text: _("<i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Crier",
            text: _("The message is given. Onwards to the next village."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Crier",
            x: 0,
            y: 18,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Crier",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rael",
            text: _("Ten acres... well, that’d be most of us. Blimey. But it is our duty."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elyn",
            text: _("You’re leading the village to war? But you’re our only veteran fighter. What will we do if the outlaws come back?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Rael",
            text: _("I have faith in you, son. Take good care of your sister. The lads and I will return before you know it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Rael",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_22",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22leader2%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_23",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Pfft. You’re just leeches... All you pearl-folk are. You’ll get... what’s coming to you..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_25",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 22,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("This battle is dragging on... if we can’t finish off these pirates soon, we won’t have enough spare hands to bring in the harvest."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_26",
        on: "side_turn_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_side",
            equals: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 30,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Thea",
            text: _("Brr, it’s starting to snow and we’re still stuck fighting. Our crops are all dead! Even if we win this battle, we’ll be sure to starve during the winter..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
